---
import metrics from '../data/metrics.json';
---

<footer class="py-16 px-6 border-t border-transit-bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-8 mb-10">
      <div>
        <a href="/Transitly" class="font-bold text-2xl text-transit-accent hover:text-transit-accent/80 transition">Transitly</a>
        <p class="text-transit-text-lo text-sm mt-1">
          TFG · Trabajo Fin de Grado · Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Multiplataforma
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="https://github.com/astralk9999/Transitly" class="text-transit-text-mid hover:text-transit-accent transition text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/astralk9999/Transitly/blob/master/LICENSE" class="text-transit-text-mid hover:text-transit-accent transition text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MIT License</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/astralk9999/Transitly/tree/master/docs" class="text-transit-text-mid hover:text-transit-accent transition text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Documentación</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-8">
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">Flutter 3.9</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">Riverpod</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">Supabase</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">Hive</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">Sentry</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">PostHog</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">FMTC</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">flutter_map</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">Astro</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-transit-bg-raised text-transit-text-lo text-xs rounded-full border border-transit-bg-raised">Tailwind</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-transit-text-lo border-t border-transit-bg-surface pt-8">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <p>{metrics.context.author} · {metrics.context.school} · {metrics.context.course}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <span>Defensa: {metrics.context.defenseDate}</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline text-transit-bg-raised">|</span>
        <span>Multi-operador · España</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 p-6 glass-card border border-transit-accent/10">
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm leading-relaxed italic text-center">
        "Gracias por leer esta memoria. Transitly nace para que cualquier persona —en cualquier ciudad media y con cualquier capacidad— sepa dónde está su autobús ahora mismo."
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
